OL,3,GNEWSANepalese restaurant fundraises for
OL,4,Afloods victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nepalese restaurant owner is raising
OL,7,Fmoney to help people affected by
OL,8,Fdevastating floods in the country.
OL,10,FMore than 1,000 people are known to
OL,11,Fhave died, and more than 5,000 are
OL,12,Fstill missing, after a flash flood
OL,13,Fbelieved to have been triggered by a
OL,14,Fglacial collapse, swept through border
OL,15,Fvillages two weeks ago.
OL,17,FRobin Sharma owns two venues in
OL,18,FShrewsbury, the Avatar in Mardol, and
OL,19,FYak & Yeti in Frankwell, and decided to
OL,20,Fhost charity dinner nights every Monday
OL,21,Fin September.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
